      "source": [
        "# VLM Lighting Defect Inference\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook runs **inference** with a base VLM to **describe lighting defects** and creates a **heuristic mask** for lighting anomalies.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Model selection logic**\n",
        "- Try **Qwen2‑VL** via `AutoModelForVision2Seq` (requires newer Transformers).\n",
        "- If unavailable, fall back to **LLaVA** via `LlavaForConditionalGeneration`.\n"
      ],
      "id": "6blgfSddIBKH"
    },
